<p>Marked Share is live and ready to use. Head over to <a href="https://share.markedapp.com">share.markedapp.com</a> to create a free account, explore the <a href="https://share.markedapp.com/docs">Marked Share documentation</a> for full details and API specs, and check out the <a href="https://share.markedapp.com/u/ttscoff/c/marked-share">Marked Share development log</a> for a live example.</p>

